{"content":[{"c":["BAAL-HAZOR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Mountain home of King David’s son Absalom. Two years after Amnon raped Absalom’s sister Tamar (Amnon’s half sister), Absalom invited Amnon and his other brothers to a feast at Baal-hazor at sheepshearing time (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.21-30","r":"2Sam.13.21-30","rawR":"2Sam.13.21-30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.21-30","value":"2Sam.13.21-30"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 13:21-30"},"). During the festivities, Absalom got his revenge: he had Amnon killed."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Baal-hazor is not to be confused with the Hazor in Benjamin’s territory (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.33","r":"Neh.11.33","rawR":"Neh.11.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.33","value":"Neh.11.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:33"},") or the Hazor north of the Sea of Galilee in Naphtali’s territory (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.11.10-11","r":"Josh.11.10-11","rawR":"Josh.11.10-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.11.10-11","value":"Josh.11.10-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 11:10-11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.9.15","r":"1Kgs.9.15","rawR":"1Kgs.9.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.9.15","value":"1Kgs.9.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 9:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","r":"2Kgs.15.29","rawR":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.15.29","value":"2Kgs.15.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 15:29"},"). Baal-hazor was located in the territory of Ephraim at Jebel el-Asur, northeast of Bethel."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BaalHazor","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 13:21-30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.13.21-30","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.13.21-30","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.13.21-30"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.33","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.33","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.33"},{"anchorText":"Jos 11:10-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.11.10-11","rawQueryValue":"Josh.11.10-11","sourceRefExact":"Josh.11.10-11"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 9:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.9.15","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.9.15","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.9.15"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 15:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.15.29"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5f95b3801a1c782dcf6c6abeaece07efa582b840f3f8b957ea07545b0129b203","sourceItemName":"BaalHazor","sourceItemOrder":12,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BaalHazor","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Baal-Hazor","title":"Baal-Hazor","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}